# No API keys or secrets are required to run this project.
# Both data sources are public and unauthenticated:
#   - CISA KEV catalog: https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog
#   - FIRST EPSS API:    https://api.first.org/data/v1/epss
#
# If you later point the script at a private scanner API (e.g. Qualys/Tenable),
# put credentials here -- and NEVER commit this file:
# SCANNER_API_USER=
# SCANNER_API_PASS=
